<title>BELGIUM: Belgium's Colruyt sees higher full yr 96/97 profit.</title>
<headline>Belgium's Colruyt sees higher full yr 96/97 profit.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian retailer Colruyt SA said in a statement on Wednesday it expected full year 1996/1997 consolidated net profit to be at least 2.15 billion Belgian francs compared to 1.934 the previous year.</p>
<p>Colruyt's financial year ends on March 31, and its annual results will be published at the end of June.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
